  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Water Management in the SADC/Zambezi Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish support to water management in the SADC/Zambezi Region 2012-2016 will improve water resources development and management in Southern Africa with a specific focus on the Zambezi river basin, the largest river basin in Southern Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
